=== sh % on if goes to elif
text:
  if [ a ]; then
    echo "if"
  elif b; then
    :
  else
    for x in y; do
      :
    done
  fi
cursor: 1,1
ext: matchit
filetype: sh
keys: %
--- vim 9.1
expect-text:
  if [ a ]; then
    echo "if"
  elif b; then
    :
  else
    for x in y; do
      :
    done
  fi
expect-cursor: 3,1
expect-mode: normal

=== sh % on elif goes to else
